<title>TAIWAN: Taiwan stock market closed for holiday.</title>
<headline>Taiwan stock market closed for holiday.</headline>
<dateline>TAIPEI 1997-03-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Taiwan's stock market is closed on Saturday for a national holiday. It will reopen on Monday.</p>
<p>On Friday, the benchmark stock index finished 29.99 points or 0.37 percent higher to 8,119.70.</p>
<p>-- James Peng (5080815)</p>
